    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, that sounds like something from a textbook. it doesn't really feel like that. it feels more like... if i just stopped showing up, the city would just keep breathing exactly the same way. like i'm just a glitch that's about to be corrected. it's almost a relief to think about how little space i actually take up.",
